- EN: recent searches → pl-PL: ostatnie wyszukiwania | Definition: A list of previous search queries. | Example: Miejsca docelowe wybrane na podstawie Twoich ostatnich wyszukiwań
- EN: Recommended Provider → pl-PL: Świetny dostawca | Definition: A booking partner that meets our top-quality criteria, demonstrated by a high Partner Quality Score, strong price accuracy, and reliable downstream visibility. This designation helps travelers make informed choices by identifying partners that offer a trustworthy and seamless booking experience.
