- EN: Satisfactory → pl-PL: Zadowalająca | Definition: Rating indicating acceptable quality or performance, but with some issues.
- EN: Saved → pl-PL: Zapisane | Definition: For travellers planning one or more trips, this feature empowers users to save different elements of their travel, so they can compare and monitor prices, book at a time that suits and/or find the perfect option.
- EN: Savvy Search → pl-PL: Planuj z AI | Definition: Savvy Search is a generative AI planning tool developed internally. It is designed to help travelers discover new destinations and experiences by asking questions like "What kind of trip is on your mind?" This tool is powered by OpenAI's ChatGPT and uses historical internet data along with Skyscanner's destination and price data to provide travel recommendations | Notes: Product feature | Example: Przedstawiamy narzędzie Planuj z AI

