- EN: self-transfer → pl-PL: przesiadka na ryzyko pasażera | Definition: When passengers need to transfer between flights on their own without airline assistance. It may be necessary to check in separately for each connecting flight. | Example: Ta podróż obejmuje przesiadkę na ryzyko pasażera.
- EN: Shelf Discovery → pl-PL: Sklepowe buszowanie | Definition: In 2026, travellers are redefining what it means to eat like a local. Dining out at restaurants is no longer the only way to taste a destination — the real flavour is found in the country's food aisles. 
